WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.000
-Finally, guys, I know a lot
of people find math boring.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.501
Well, that's why we've updated
math to make the equations

00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:07.033
about stuff
that you can relate to.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:08.767
It's time for
"Popular Mathematics".

00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:09.934
Here we go.

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:11.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.868 --> 00:00:14.667
-♪ Popular mathematics ♪

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:16.501
♪ Mathematics ♪

00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:17.801
-Yes!

00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:19.501
Let's take a look
at our first equation here.

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:23.334
If you take "M3GAN" plus
physical fitness,

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:24.968
it equals Meghan Trainor.

00:00:24.968 --> 00:00:26.000
You see what I'm saying?
-Ah.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.667
-Meghan Trainor.
-Meghan Trainor, yeah.

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:28.834
-You get the idea.
-Trainor.

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:29.834
-Here's another one.

00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:32.601
T.J. Maxx plus a sale equals

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:34.267
"Everything Everywhere
All at Once".

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:37.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:37.734 --> 00:00:40.934
If you take the Kool-Aid Man
plus Sam Elliott,

00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:43.000
it equals the Chiefs'
head coach, Andy Reid.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.767
-I see it.

00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:48.767
-Oh, yeah.
-Here's another one.

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:51.868
You arm plus cutting an avocado

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:53.367
minus paying attention

00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:54.767
equals Thing.

00:00:54.767 --> 00:00:59.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.767
If you take Caesar...
-Yep.

00:01:01.767 --> 00:01:04.133
-...plus six shots of tequila,

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:06.000
it equals SZA.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:09.834
Hail SZA.

00:01:09.834 --> 00:01:10.834
Here's another one.

00:01:10.834 --> 00:01:13.167
"Dumb and Dumber" minus dumb

00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:14.601
plus a Boston accent

00:01:14.601 --> 00:01:16.434
equals "Dahmer".

00:01:16.434 --> 00:01:21.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:21.534 --> 00:01:23.067
-Popular.

00:01:23.067 --> 00:01:25.234
-If you take Daniel Day-Lewis...
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:25.234 --> 00:01:28.634
-...times two plus Sandra Oh,
it equals...

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:31.934
[ Singing ] ♪ Day-o, day-o ♪

00:01:31.934 --> 00:01:34.334
