for 100 miles equals,

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.501
"Welp, this is
where I live now."

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:43.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:45.234
That's what I mean.

00:01:45.234 --> 00:01:47.200
And finally, if you take
"The Bachelor"

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.200
